<title>ITALY: Naples air cargo traffic January 1997 detailed.</title>
<headline>Naples air cargo traffic January 1997 detailed.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air cargo traffic handled at Naples Capodichino airport in January 1997 totalled 234.1 tonnes, down 22.4 percent against the same period 1996, airport authority GESAC said.</p>
<p>					    Pct change</p>
<p>					    against Jan 96</p>
<p> Import traffic	  246.2	down 18.9</p>
<p> Cargo flown		99.7	down 11.3</p>
<p> via truck		 146.4	down 23.4</p>
<p> Export traffic	  134.3	down 28.9</p>
<p> Cargo flown	     134.3	down 28.9</p>
<p> via truck		 n/a	  n/a</p>
<p> Total traffic	   380.5	down 22.8</p>
<p> Cargo flown	     234.1	down 22.4</p>
<p> via truck		 146.4	down 23.4</p>
<p> Total mail		181.3	up   18.7</p>
<p> Total passengers    167,361	up   14.2</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
